### 32. Replace a form's questions — WARNING: mutates {{ownFormId}}, deletes any question not listed here
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/forms/{{ownFormId}}/questions
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questions": [
    { "text": "Qual sua idade?", "questionType": "TEXT", "order": 1 }
  ]
}

### 33. Replace a form's questions — empty questions array (expect 400 Bad Request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/forms/{{ownFormId}}/questions
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questions": []
}

